MODULE: HistoryConvergesBatchRevisionsDropped
TARGET: HistoryConverges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: numeric membership commits but the accumulative composition silently drops the batch revisions
PERTURBS: Flush

--- FIND
    /\ history' = IF outcome = "commit"
                  THEN history \cup Revision(Batch) ELSE history
    /\ seen' = IF outcome = "commit" THEN seen \cup Batch ELSE seen
--- REPLACE
    /\ history' = history
    /\ seen' = seen
--- END
